cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "Annual profit-based unit commitment models for price-taking natural gas-fired power plants"
abstract: >-
  MIQP, piecewise linear MILP and dynamic programming implementations of the
  profit-based unit commitment problem of a price-taking natural gas-fired
  generating unit, solved over a full annual horizon of 8,784 hours, together
  with sample input data for a literature benchmark unit.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-16"
license: MIT
